{
  "_comment": [
    "Two floppy drives, each with a swap list, and a hard disk. The frontend",
    "mounts every file read-only: what the machine writes to a disk is kept in",
    "the machine's memory (waterbox/chimera-overlay.c), so states carry it and",
    "your file is never changed. CD-ROMs come later: a CD drive's audio is a",
    "thread of 86Box's that is not yet made to run in place."
  ],
